---
// Pastor section
---

<section id="pastor" class="px-6 lg:px-12 py-[120px] bg-cream">
  <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.2fr] gap-[100px] items-center">
    <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-[0_32px_64px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] reveal">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507003211169-0a1dd7228f2d?w=800&q=80" alt="Pastor Daniel Mwangi" class="w-full h-[600px] object-cover">
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="inline-block text-gold text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-[2px] uppercase mb-4">Our Leadership</span>
      <h2 class="text-[clamp(36px,4vw,48px)] text-navy mb-2">Pr. Daniel Mwangi</h2>
      <div class="text-gold text-base font-medium mb-6">Senior Pastor</div>
      <p class="text-text-light text-[17px] leading-relaxed mb-4">With a heart for ministry and a passion for sharing the Gospel, Pastor Daniel Mwangi leads our congregation with wisdom, compassion, and a genuine love for God's people.</p>
      <p class="text-text-light text-[17px] leading-relaxed mb-4">Trained at Bugema University and ordained in 2010, Pastor Mwangi has faithfully served churches across East Africa before joining Nyaura in 2021. He and his wife Grace have three children.</p>
      <div class="mt-8 p-8 bg-white border-l-4 border-gold rounded-r-2xl">
        <p class="font-heading text-xl italic text-navy leading-relaxed">"Come as you are. God has a plan for your life, and it starts with you taking the first step through those doors."</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-6 mt-8 pt-8 border-t border-black/8">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-text-light text-sm">
          <span>📧</span> <strong class="text-navy">pastor@nyaurachurch.org</strong>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-text-light text-sm">
          <span>📞</span> <strong class="text-navy">+254 7XX XXX XXX</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
